          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\">Easy patient transport.</span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The simple design of our transport stretcher provides safe and efficient transport for an economical value.</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Fifth wheel mobility</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Metal tooth and groove braking system</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Option of four sided brake and steer control</span></li>\n</ul>\n",
